 🎮 (how typical, right?)\nandrogynous, but biologically male\n\ni leave the details (pose, face, setting, etc) to you\n\ni look forward to seeing the final result! 💚", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@Rasalas388/works/35", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/44bfe170/uploads/origins/5178e8c5-ac30-45ce-a579-fc364b118d34?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=f7f54a765e6e36127163250f9423baa6", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/44bfe170/uploads/origins/5178e8c5-ac30-45ce-a579-fc364b118d34?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=f7f54a765e6e36127163250f9423baa6, https://si.imgix.net/44bfe170/uploads/origins/5178e8c5-ac30-45ce-a579-fc364b118d34?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=b5c26356148be1b733b458a10de374be 2x, https://si.imgix.net/44bfe170/uploads/origins/5178e8c5-ac30-45ce-a579-fc364b118d34?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=75dc40a69a435a1cec28c8b92af90259 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "私のVtuberキャラクターのアートワーク。  ビデオゲーム、映画、コンサート、ミュージカル鑑賞、蕎麦を飲むのが大好きなアンドロイドの猫人間です。\n\nhttps://x.com/galaxysystem0/status/1774254826299547653?s=46&t=aJzg677AjRJUL_6NmuA_Bg\n\nhttps://x.com/galaxysystem0/status/1774254826299547653?s=46&t=aJzg677AjRJUL_6NmuA_Bg", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@Rasalas388/works/34", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/e6c6f7e4/uploads/origins/156f681f-a91e-4813-8533-9df6bae2628b?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=7b4c8a606b43986305179452f6d67b65", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/e6c6f7e4/uploads/origins/156f681f-a91e-4813-8533-9df6bae2628b?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=7b4c8a606b43986305179452f6d67b65, https://si.imgix.net/e6c6f7e4/uploads/origins/156f681f-a91e-4813-8533-9df6bae2628b?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h